WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.080
Call the intended recipient, then state your location, the
situation and your request. Ask for acknowledgement on the
approved channel.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:19.560
At handover, explain lane conditions, current hazards and the
emergency route. Confirm the transfer of responsibility before
leaving your post.

